<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 900 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 91-day T-bills worth 900 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 900 million pounds for auction on July 9 and issue on July 10 when 91-day bills worth 973.250 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.816 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
